entityDescription:
The society has the following subjects:
1. The study, design, implementation, sell, management, assistance nd update of informatic systems, software and related data, owned by the society itself or by other subjects, in the field of aerospace engineering;
2. supply of services, feasibility studies, sizing of test cases, the development of innovative proposal in the engineering fields, with particular attention to the aerospace field;
3. Research activities and collaborations with reserch centers and universities;
3. The advertisement, the selling, the installation and integration of HW/SW.
